# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository and in every checkout,
# independent of each contributor's core.autocrlf. Benchmark CSVs are part of
# the reproducibility contract (their SHA-256 is pinned in
# benchmark_data/MANIFEST.csv), so their bytes must not depend on the OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary
